## Mission definitions: 20 main missions.
##   type             "eliminate" (kill `goal` aliens), "survive" (last `goal` seconds),
##                    "hunt" (kill `goal` of `target`), "boss" (destroy the Mothership)
##   goal             kills, seconds, or number of the target type
##   target           alien type to hunt (hunt missions only)
##   mix              spawn weights: scout, soldier, flyer, heavy
##   risk             1 to 3, shown to the player. Higher risk pays more.
##   min_rank         rank index needed (0 = Recruit)
##   attack_chance    chance (0 to 1) that the base is attacked during the mission
